            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The example above is trivial, but my version of `pretty_path` shortens long directory paths and provides separate highlight groups for directory and filename. In order to do so in the inactive status line, I need the expansion for `%:p` for the inactive window versus the current buffer and window.",
